  "body": "Located in Ara Hills, this brand-new two-level home combines modern design with a practical and flexible family layout. One of the key highlights is the double internal- access garage, along with 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and 2 living areas arranged across both levels.\r\n\r\nStep inside to a modern black kitchen with an island bench and quality Bosch appliances. The open-plan dining and living area opens out to the deck and backyard, making it easy to move between indoors and out. The good-sized backyard gives children room to play and is also a great spot for entertaining or relaxing outside. Also on the ground floor is a bedroom with a semi-ensuite, providing useful flexibility for guests, teenagers or extended family.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a second family living area gives everyone another place to relax. The master bedroom gets plenty of natural light through large windows and features a well- appointed ensuite with double vanity and bathtub. Two further bedrooms share the family bathroom, completing the upper level.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Approx. 204sqm floor area, positioned beside a walkway\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and 2 separate living areas\r\n• Double internal-access garage+2 off-street parking\r\n• Modern black kitchen with island bench and Bosch appliances\r\n• Ground-floor bedroom with semi-ensuite\r\n• Light-filled master suite with double vanity and bathtub \r\n\r\nClose to Orewa Beach, local cafés, schools and shops, with easy motorway access making commuting simple and convenient.\r\n\r\nWith a double garage, flexible layout and a good-sized backyard, there is plenty here for a family to enjoy. Come along and have a look, we'd be happy to show you around.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
